Package: BLASTr
Title: Parallel Taxonomic Classification of Metabarcoding Sequences
Version: 0.1.7
Authors@R: c(
    person("Heron", "Hilário", , "heronoh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2548-1053")),
    person("Lucio", "Queiroz", , "luciorqueiroz@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6090-1834"))
  )
Description: Seamlessly run 'BLAST' searches within 'R', tailored for the
    taxonomic identification of amplicon sequences. This package offers a
    robust set of functions designed to efficiently identify and process
    sequences from high-throughput metabarcoding and metagenomic
    experiments, following best practices for sequence data analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/heronoh/BLASTr, https://heronoh.github.io/BLASTr/
